    {
      "id": "p0229-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During a murderous No Mercy playthrough, it becomes clear that the player and the main character aren't one and the same. Further clues suggest that the locket and this other \"entity\" share a dark, complicated history. For these reasons, the standard locket message becomes:",
