      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Fortunately, the team recognized the importance of the word \"The\" in this line. So, to preserve Toby's intention, the translator replaced the verb \"got\" with \"took back\". Thus, the Japanese version of this line became:",
