    {
      "id": "p0229-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Basically, by prioritizing the intent of the line over its literal wording, the localization team was able to preserve this important piece of background lore for Japanese players to analyze.",
        "raw": "Basically, by prioritizing the intent of the line over its literal wording, the\nlocalization team was able to preserve this important piece of background lore\nfor Japanese players to analyze.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10149565,
          0.64077143,
          0.69973742,
          0.69025714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09254045,
          0.64005714,
          0.70941954,
          0.69132857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          30,
          31,
          32
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "本地化团队优先考虑台词的用意，而非拘泥于字面，从而保住了这条重要的背景线索，让日本玩家也能加以分析。",
